      "description": "Jobs & Careers - Working at the University of Vienna | Job Vacancies Skip to main content Skip to navigation Skip to search Skip to footer Universität Wien | Home Open search Search sitewide Search for staff Search whole site Search Search for staff Search Universität Wien | Home Close search Toggle navigation Universität Wien | Home Close navigation Arbeiten an der Uni Wien Choose other language en de University of Vienna as an employer Back to \"Arbeiten an der Uni Wien\" University of Vienna as an employer Values Benefits Salary scheme Jobs in research and teaching Back to \"Arbeiten an der Uni Wien\" Jobs in research and teaching Work & Study - Start your career Praedoc Postdoc (Senior) Lecturer & Scientists Fellowships Jobs in administration and organisation Back to \"Arbeiten an der Uni Wien\" Jobs in administration and organisation Administration & Organisation Data & Library Services Facility Management Finanz & Controlling HR IT Kommunikation & Marketing Koordination & Management Labor & Technik Research & Teaching Services How to apply Welcome Compass Back to \"Arbeiten an der Uni Wien\" Welcome Compass (Pre-) Arrival in Austria Back to \"Welcome Compass\" (Pre-) Arrival in Austria Arrival for EU, EEA and Swiss Nationals Arrival for Third-Country Nationals Family Members Living in Austria Back to \"Welcome Compass\" Living in Austria Social Security and Healthcare Housing in Vienna Family Life in Austria Transportation in Austria and Vienna Language: Learning German in Vienna Working @ UniVie Back to \"Welcome Compass\" Working @ UniVie Welcome Events and Contact Points Services @ UniVie Employment Quicklinks Moodle (E-Learning) Webmail u:space portal for students u:find course & staff directory Intranet for employees Library Scientific and administrative units u:rise Professional & Career Development Choose other language en de Career at the University of Vienna University of Vienna. Space for personalities. Since 1365 All vacancies © [Translate to English:] An employer with added value The University of Vienna is a place where knowledge grows, because people are inspired to excel. With 20 faculties and centres, over 180 fields of study, and around 11,000 employees , it offers a work environment where everyone can find their place – whether in research , teaching , administration , technical services or management . So if you work at the University of Vienna, you get more than just a job . Together, we shape the future and contribute to society with curiosity , responsibility , and academic excellence – at one of the top 100 universities in the world. University of Vienna as an employer Jobs in research and teaching Jobs in Administration and Organisation What connects us? Do you like to take responsibility ? Do you value an international, open environment ? Do you want scope to challenge yourself and develop your skills? Curious? Discover what connects us in our 'Space for Personalities' manifesto video. When clicking the play button personal data may be transferred to Vimeo. Find out, how to apply! Further information Job profiles in focus: Gallery of our job ambassadors Are you a student or graduate of University of Vienna? Take advantage of the services offered by Uniport Career Service: Career counseling and events for students Further information © [Translate to English:] Ian Ehm LinkedIn Youtube Xing Research Gate Contact University of Vienna | Talent acquisition & development Universitätsring 1 | 1010 Wien T: +43-1-4277-0 E-mail: support.recruiting(at)univie.ac.at Quicklinks Quicklinks Moodle (E-Learning) Webmail u:space portal for students u:find course & staff directory Intranet for employees Library Scientific and administrative units u:rise Professional & Career Development Frequently visited Frequently visited University of Vienna Sitemap Data Protection Declaration Accessibility Imprint Cookies"
